Inventory is composed of Item Class:
	Use a constructor to initialize variables
    - String for the Item’s name
    - String for the Item’s description

Weapon Class Inherits Item:
	Initialize attributes for:
    - DamageType Enum for dmg_type
    - double for dmg_num
    - String for ability_desc

	public void useSkill (Enemy class named target):
		if the Weapon dmg_type equal to the target’s weakness attribute:
      		Lowers the targets health attribute by the dmg_num multiplied by 2
		else if the dmg_type equal to target strength attribute:
      		Lowers the targets health by dmg_num * 0.65
		else:
      		Lower target health by dmg_num
    	Cause the enemy’s health to drop by a fixed value if the RUPTURE is found in the enemy’s Debuffs list

Ability Class Inherits Item:
	Initialize status_effect attribute as StatusEffects Enum
	
	public void useAbility(Enemy class called target):
		Add the status_effect to the Debuffs ArrayList<StatusEffects>

Consumable Class Inherits Item:
	Initialize the amount_healed integer 
	
	public void useConsumable():
    	Increase the players health attribute by the amount_healed
